abstract: >-
  Scene text script identification is a fundamental task for multilingual text
  understanding. HieraScript is a hierarchical vision-language framework that
  combines parameter-efficient transfer learning with hierarchical semantic
  modeling, together with the HSI-3L benchmark covering 33 languages with
  three-level hierarchical annotations.
keywords:
  - scene text script identification
  - vision-language learning
  - parameter-efficient transfer learning
  - hierarchical classification
